  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      I Greet the Dawn<br>
      I greet the dawn – a streak of light,<br>
      Waking from slumbers of the night;<br>
      To see unfold a new born day,<br>
      That is mine to use now as I may;<br>
      Will my chosen path be right,<br>
      For it is still veiled from sight;<br>
      Even if some unknown plight,<br>
      Put plans in disarray,<br>
      I greet the Dawn.<br>
      Gallantly life’s trials I’ll fight,<br>
      And do my best to get it right;<br>
      For tomorrow is another day,<br>
      When everything may go my way;<br>
      Rising refreshed and with Delight,<br>
      I greet the Dawn.<br>
      By Eila Webster
    </p>
  </div>

